// Normative rule H_trap_hs_csrwrites (src/priv/hypervisor.adoc):
//   When a trap is taken into HS-mode, virtualization mode V is set to 0, and hstatus.SPV and
//     sstatus.SPP are set according to <<h-spp>>. If V was 1 before the trap, field SPVP in hstatus
//     is set the same as sstatus.SPP; otherwise, SPVP is left unchanged. A trap into HS-mode also
//     writes field GVA in hstatus, fields SPIE and SIE in sstatus, and CSRs sepc, scause, stval,
//     htval, and htinst.
//
